ed into the gap between pole position man and Sommer to take the lead. He was followed by Chiron and Etancelin.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":0,"text":"Villapadierna stalled his Maserati on the grid and it took some time before he could join the race.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":1,"text":"Chiron almost immediately passed Farina and the Monegasque was leading the field after the first lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":1,"text":"Lehoux pits with brake trouble.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":2,"text":"Soffietti hit the straw bales at Gambetta corner but was able to continue as did Etancelin after having touched some sand bags.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":8,"text":"Dreyfus, who for several laps had tried to find a way past Shuttleworth, finally took over third position","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":10,"text":"\"Raph\" touches the sidewalk at Gambetta and retires at the pits.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":10,"text":"After ten laps Chiron led by 16.8s from his teammate Dreyfus, who was now second having passed Farina.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":12,"text":"Farina pits with a broken oil pipe and retires.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":15,"text":"Nuvolari was right behind him and passed the Maserati on lap 15. The Scuderia Ferrari drivers were now holding the top three positions.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":16,"text":"Lehoux retires at the pits with brake trouble; Zehender out with ignition problems.","q":false,"c":11},{"lap":22,"text":"Thus on the 22nd lap Nuvolari took over the lead from Chiron.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":27,"text":"Chiron retakes the lead; Nuvolari drops to third behind Dreyfus.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":30,"text":"Dreyfus now passed Chiron and led the race by 2.4 seconds after 30 laps with Nuvolari a further 4.8 seconds behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":33,"text":"Chiron back in front; Etancelin briefly third.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":34,"text":"Dreyfus leads again; Villapadierna retires with steering trouble.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":39,"text":"Nuvolari passes Dreyfus for the lead; Etancelin stops 1m21s for fuel.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":45,"text":"R\u00fcesch crashes after a fuel leak; the car catches fire and he is out.","q":false,"c":8},{"lap":46,"text":"Nuvolari leads by 11 seconds; Dreyfus drops to third behind Chiron.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":53,"text":"Nuvolari and Shuttleworth pit to refuel: 28 and 47 seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":57,"text":"Chiron (27 s, lap 55) and Dreyfus (36 s, lap 57) have refuelled; Nuvolari still leads.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":62,"text":"Etancelin pits for brakes; Zehender takes over and leaves after 4m21s.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":67,"text":"on the 67th lap he made a surprise visit to the pits for a glass of water. The car stood still for just 9 seconds and he returned to the race in second position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":70,"text":"Nuvolari laps in a record 1m41.1s, 1.6 seconds behind Chiron.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":75,"text":"Nuvolari retakes the lead from Chiron after running wide at Gambetta.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":80,"text":"Chiron leads on lap 79, Nuvolari passes him again a lap later.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":87,"text":"Etancelin's Maserati, Zehender driving, refuels but will not restart; it is out.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":89,"text":"Shuttleworth stops out on the circuit without water and retires.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":100,"text":"Nuvolari wins from Chiron and Dreyfus, the three within 12 seconds; Sommer fourth, four laps down.","q":false,"c":0}]}